# Advisories accepted by ADR-026 (the reviewed audit allowlist, https://github.com/henniefrancis/aws-re_invent-compass/wiki/Decisions-Security-and-Privacy#a-reviewed-allowlist-for-npm-audit).
# Empty since 4 November 2026: the three advisories once listed here
# (GHSA-86w9-cpqp-85rv in node-forge, GHSA-6h2x-m376-mqjq and GHSA-wr44-6hxh-3jwq
# in joi) were fixed by node-forge 1.4.2 and the joi 17.13.9 override, matching
# the empty allowlist in .github/scripts/audit-check.mjs. Every HIGH or CRITICAL
# advisory fails the Trivy filesystem scan. An entry goes back here only with the
# same ADR-026 review as the npm audit allowlist: Trivy matches ignores on the CVE
# id, so list the CVE id with the GHSA id in the comment above it.
